# Lead data folders (profiles + assets) are LOCAL-ONLY — never committed, so
# prospective-customer business data never lands in the repo. Every per-lead folder
# (scripts/leads/{lead}/) is ignored; only the shared infra is tracked:
#   README.md, types.ts (the LeadProfile contract), and this file.
#
# Consequence: the "Seed Lead Sandbox" GitHub Action has no profiles to seed from —
# lead seeding is local-only (supply the profile + images on your machine).
*/
